SON data. It uses the "},{"code":"JSONDecoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to decode the stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data into an array of INotification objects. If the decoding is successful, it returns the decoded array."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If any errors occur during decoding or if the data is not found, an empty array is returned."}]},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The INotification type is assumed to conform to the Codable protocol. The INotification type represents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the structure of the notification objects you want to store and retrieve."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"saveDoNotShowNotification(notification:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"INotification"}]}]},{"style":"warning","name":"Warning","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure that the INotification type conforms to the Codable protocol and has the same structure as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data stored in the “doNotShowNotifications” key. In case of discrepancies, decoding errors may occur."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/auroraeditor\/localstorage\/listdonotshownotifications()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor\/documentation\/AuroraEditor","doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor\/documentation\/AuroraEditor\/LocalStorage"]]},"references":{"doc://com.auroraeditor/documentation/AuroraEditor/LocalStorage/listDoNotShowNotifications()":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auroraeditor